# Leave empty when using the Vite development proxy to localhost:8000.
# Public API origin only. Never put model keys or AWS credentials in VITE_*.
# The single-container image also leaves this empty and serves the API same-origin.
# Split production hosting needs an HTTPS API URL plus an exact backend CORS origin.
VITE_YOUTHLM_API_BASE_URL=
# Legacy VITE_API_BASE_URL is also accepted when the canonical variable is empty.
